# Untouched originals of photographs that have been resized for the web. Kept
# on disk so a crop or a quality can be redone from the source, but everything
# under public/ is published as-is, and these are multi-megabyte files nothing
# on the page ever asks for.
public/images/_full/

# Discarded frames, parked next to the ones in use rather than deleted. Same
# reason: local only, never published.
public/**/old/

# Source artwork — kept locally, never shipped and never committed.
assets/
